'''Bazooka Bros.''' (Wバズーカ, ''W Bazūka'', '''Double Bazooka''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

